.         
.         * Controls in the regression
. 
.         * Gender (dummy for female respondent)
.         
.         gen     female = 0

.         replace female = 1 if sex == 2
(46,209 real changes made)

.         
.         * Age: We use year of birth to generate age (Note: Not clear to us wh
> ether we can use bioage)
.         gen     age  = syear - gebjahr

.         gen             age2 = (age * age)/100

. 
.         * Replace missing values for non-valid responses to control variable 
> (level of in education, marital status, religion, income...)
.         replace pgisced11 = .   if      pgisced11 <= 0
(28,902 real changes made, 28,902 to missing)

.         replace pgfamstd = .    if      pgfamstd <= 0
(221 real changes made, 221 to missing)

